#. Skin Element Text: txt- pulau anak krakatau / Text
msgid ""
"Selamat datang di kawasan Gunung Anak Krakatau, salah satu gunung api paling "
"aktif dan ikonik di Indonesia yang berada di perairan Selat Sunda. Anak "
"Krakatau merupakan hasil aktivitas vulkanik lanjutan dari letusan dahsyat "
"Gunung Krakatau tahun 1883, dan mulai muncul ke permukaan pada tahun 1927. "
"Hingga kini, Anak Krakatau terus tumbuh dan menjadi laboratorium alam yang "
"sangat penting bagi penelitian geologi, vulkanologi, dan ekosistem pesisir. "
"Kawasan ini memiliki keanekaragaman hayati yang unik, mulai dari vegetasi "
"pionir hingga kehidupan laut yang kaya. Selain memiliki nilai ilmiah tinggi, "
"Anak Krakatau juga menjadi destinasi wisata alam dan edukasi yang menarik "
"bagi wisatawan lokal maupun mancanegara. Kami mengundang Anda untuk "
"menyaksikan secara langsung keajaiban alam, dinamika bumi, serta proses "
"terbentuknya kehidupan baru di salah satu fenomena geologi paling "
"menakjubkan di dunia."
msgstr ""
"Deskripsi: Welcome to the Mount Anak Krakatau area, one of the most active "
"and iconic volcanoes in Indonesia, located in the waters of the Sunda "
"Strait. Anak Krakatau is the result of continued volcanic activity following "
"the massive eruption of Mount Krakatau in 1883, and it first emerged above "
"sea level in 1927. To this day, Anak Krakatau continues to grow and serves "
"as an important natural laboratory for geological, volcanological, and "
"coastal ecosystem research. This area features unique biodiversity, ranging "
"from pioneer vegetation to rich marine life. In addition to its high "
"scientific value, Anak Krakatau is also an attractive destination for nature "
"tourism and educational visits for both local and international visitors. We "
"invite you to witness firsthand the wonders of nature, the dynamic forces of "
"the earth, and the process of new life formation in one of the most "
"fascinating geological phenomena in the world."

#. Skin Element Text: txt- pulau sebesi / Text
msgid ""
"Selamat datang di Pulau Sebesi, surga petualangan di Selat Sunda, Lampung "
"Selatan! Pulau berpenghuni ini menawarkan trekking ke Gunung Sebesi,\n"
"snorkeling di terumbu karang yang memukau, dan pemandangan Krakatau yang "
"epik. Berjarak 1,5 jam perahu dari Kalianda, Sebesi menyuguhkan\n"
" pengalaman alam autentik dengan keramahan warga lokal. Nikmati homestay "
"sederhana, kuliner ikan segar, dan petualangan seru seperti memancing\n"
" atau menjelajah pantai sepanjang 19 km. Cocok untuk pecinta alam dan "
"petualang sejati, Pulau Sebesi siap menciptakan kenangan liburan yang tak\n"
" terlupakan. Ayo, mulai petualangan Anda sekarang!"
msgstr ""
"Welcome to Sebesi Island, an adventure paradise in the Sunda Strait, South "
"Lampung! This inhabited island, located just a 1.5-hour boat ride from "
"Kalianda, offers trekking to Mount Sebesi, snorkeling in stunning coral "
"reefs, and epic views of Krakatau. Experience the authentic local "
"hospitality, enjoy simple homestays and fresh seafood, and dive into "
"thrilling activities like fishing or exploring the 19 km coastline. Perfect "
"for nature lovers and true adventurers, Sebesi Island is ready to create "
"unforgettable holiday memories!"

