#. Skin Element Text: txt-pulau sebuku / Text
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Selamat datang di Pulau Sebeku, permata tak berpenghuni di Lampung Selatan! "
"Nikmati keindahan laut jernih, terumbu karang yang kaya, dan panorama "
"eksotis yang sempurna untuk fotografi drone. Hanya 20 menit perahu dari "
"Pulau Sebesi, destinasi ini menawarkan snorkeling dengan hiu jinak, piknik "
"pantai, dan ketenangan alam liar. Cocok untuk petualang dan konten kreator, "
"Pulau Sebeku menghadirkan pengalaman eksklusif di Selat Sunda. Dengan "
"fasilitas dasar dan akses mudah, pulau ini siap memanjakan Anda dengan "
"keindahan bawah laut dan suasana tenang. Ayo, ciptakan momen tak terlupakan "
"di sini!"
msgstr ""
"Welcome to Sebeku Island, an uninhabited gem in South Lampung! Enjoy the "
"beauty of its clear waters, rich coral reefs, and exotic panorama, all just "
"a 20-minute boat ride from Sebesi Island. This perfect destination for "
"adventurers and content creators offers exclusive experiences like "
"snorkeling with docile sharks, beach picnics, and the tranquility of the "
"wild, making it a serene getaway in the Sunda Strait for creating "
"unforgettable moments!"

#. Skin Element Text: txt-pulau umang umang / Text
msgid ""
"Selamat datang di Pulau Umang-umang, oase kecil di Lampung Selatan! Pulau "
"tak berpenghuni ini menawarkan pasir putih, \n"
"air jernih, dan pemandangan Krakatau yang memukau. Hanya 20 menit perahu "
"dari Pulau Sebesi, destinasi ini sempurna untuk \n"
"snorkeling, piknik romantis, atau menikmati sunset spektakuler. Dengan "
"suasana tenang dan alam yang masih alami, Pulau\n"
" Umang-umang cocok untuk pelarian dari hiruk-pikuk kota. Fasilitas sederhana "
"dan akses mudah menjadikan pulau ini pilihan \n"
"ideal untuk liburan intim atau petualangan ringan. Ayo, rasakan ketenangan "
"dan keindahan alam di Pulau Umang-umang sekarang!"
msgstr ""
"Welcome to Umang-umang Island, a small oasis in South Lampung! This "
"uninhabited island offers white sand, clear water, and a stunning view of "
"Krakatau. Just a 20-minute boat ride from Sebesi Island, this destination is "
"perfect for snorkeling, a romantic picnic, or enjoying a spectacular sunset. "
"With its quiet atmosphere and pristine nature, Umang-umang Island is "
"suitable for an escape from the city hustle. Simple facilities and easy "
"access make this island an ideal choice for an intimate getaway or a light "
"adventure. Come and experience the tranquility and natural beauty of Umang-"
"umang Island now!"

#. Skin Element Text: txt-pulaumengkudu / Text
msgid ""
"Selamat datang di Pulau Mengkudu, sebuah destinasi pantai tersembunyi yang "
"mempesona di Kabupaten Lampung Selatan. Daya tarik utamanya adalah fenomena "
"alam \"jembatan pasir\" unik yang muncul saat air laut surut, memungkinkan "
"Anda berjalan kaki dari pulau ke daratan seberang. Dikelilingi oleh air laut "
"yang jernih kehijauan dan pasir putih yang lembut, Mengkudu adalah surga "
"ideal untuk berenang dan bersantai. Jangan lewatkan kesempatan mengabadikan "
"momen di atas jembatan pasir yang seolah membelah lautan, menciptakan latar "
"foto yang sangat spektakuler. Kami mengundang Anda untuk menikmati keindahan "
"alami Pulau Mengkudu yang masih terjaga ini dengan penuh kegembiraan dan "
"tanggung jawab."
msgstr ""
"Welcome to Mengkudu Island, a charming hidden beach destination in South "
"Lampung Regency. Its main attraction is the unique natural phenomenon of a "
"\"sand bridge\" that emerges at low tide, allowing you to walk from the "
"island to the opposite mainland. Surrounded by clear, greenish-blue seawater "
"and soft white sand, Mengkudu is an ideal paradise for swimming and "
"relaxation. Don't miss the chance to capture the moment on the sand bridge, "
"which seems to divide the ocean, creating a truly spectacular photo "
"backdrop. We invite you to enjoy the unspoiled natural beauty of Mengkudu "
"Island with joy and responsibility."

#. Skin Element Text: txt-riobythebeach / Text
msgid ""
"Selamat datang di Pantai Rio by the Beach, destinasi wisata alam terbaru di "
"Lampung Selatan yang memukau!  Dibuka pada April 2024 oleh fotografer "
"kenamaan Rio Motret, pantai ini menghadirkan hamparan pasir putih lembut, "
"ombak tenang, dan sunset spektakuler menghadap Krakatau. Hanya 1 jam dari "
"Bandar Lampung, nikmati konsep back to nature dengan fasilitas eco-friendly "
"seperti gazebo bambu, bean bag, dan food court seafood segar. Cocok untuk  "
"liburan keluarga, pasangan, atau healing solo. Rasakan ketenangan, spot foto "
"Instagramable, dan live music mingguan.\n"
" Jadikan Rio by the Beach pilihan utama untuk petualangan pantai yang "
"autentik dan berkesan!"
msgstr ""
"Welcome to Rio by the Beach, the newest captivating natural tourist "
"destination in South Lampung, opened in April 2024 by renowned photographer "
"Rio Motret, offering a stretch of soft white sand, calm waves, and "
"spectacular sunsets facing Krakatau. Located just one hour from Bandar "
"Lampung, guests can enjoy a \"back to nature\" concept with eco-friendly "
"facilities like bamboo gazebos and a fresh seafood food court, making it "
"perfect for family vacations, couples' retreats, or solo healing, complete "
"with tranquility, Instagrammable photo spots, and weekly live music for an "
"authentic and memorable beach adventure."

